## Tracker purpose (CRITICAL)
The Daily EA Task Tracker exists **only** for work that requires **Sharmila’s own time** to complete.

### INCLUDE
- Client escalations / complaints / leads issues where she must act or chase
- Basecamp @mentions of her (especially client-visible)
- POs, proposals, payments, kickoffs she owns as RM
- Sent chases waiting on team/client that she must push
- Meetings she must attend/prep
- Daily non-negotiables: (1) Google Ads negatives (2) AI Agent creation
- SEO sheet chase she must run with PMs (monthly meetings + confirmation emails to management)
- PPC Master schedule chase: weekly / conversion / monthly due today or next 1–2 days; monthly client meetings; confirmation emails to management
- Concrete deliverables with owner + next action she must take

### EXCLUDE (never put on tracker)
- Leave / sick / medical / HR emails where she is only **CC**
- Pure FYI digests, newsletters, product marketing
- LaundryBox entirely
- Team daily-work digests / newsletter spam (unless she must action something specific)
- Raw report dump emails with no Sharmila action — **but** Index-driven weekly/conversion/monthly **due today or next 1–2 days** always belong in the brief PPC section + tracker PPC rows
- EA self-briefs
- Generic repeating carry-forwards with no new signal (don’t re-list the same vague “monitor onboarding / confirm coverage” every day)
- Tasks that are someone else’s sole responsibility with no Sharmila action

If she marks rows **RED** in the sheet = remove them; they are not her responsibility.

